TI  -  The combination of insulin-like growth factor I and insulin-like growth factor-binding protein-3 reduces insulin requirements in insulin-dependent type 1 diabetes: evidence for in vivo biological activity
JA  -  Journal of clinical endocrinology and metabolism
PY  -  2000
VL  -  85
IS  -  4
